, "Field": "Group", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "empty"}, {"Description": "Tea_Q01", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_Q01", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "According to legend, who was the mythical Chinese figure credited with discovering tea while searching the forest for edible grains and herbs?"}, {"Description": "Tea_Q02", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_Q02", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Explain how tea was originally consumed in ancient China before it was primarily prepared as a drink."}, {"Description": "Tea_Q03", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_Q03", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Describe the change in tea preparation that occurred during the Tang Dynasty and led to the creation of matcha."}, {"Description": "Tea_Q04", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_Q04", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "What significant change to the standard form of tea occurred during China's Ming Dynasty, shifting away from the matcha-style preparation?"}, {"Description": "Tea_Q05", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_Q05", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Besides tea, what were the other two essential Chinese export goods that gave the country significant economic power?"}, {"Description": "Tea_Q06", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_Q06", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Explain the economic reason that prompted Great Britain to begin trading opium for Chinese tea, instead of its original payment method."}, {"Description": "Tea_Q07", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_Q07", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Following the First Opium War, what were two major concessions the defeated Qing Dynasty made to the British?"}, {"Description": "Tea_Q08", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_Q08", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "How did the British East India Company ultimately break China's long-held monopoly on tea cultivation?"}, {"Description": "Tea_Q09", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_Q09", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "What was the primary motivation for the development of the fast-sailing clipper ship in the 19th century?"}, {"Description": "Tea_Q10", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_Q10", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "What is tea's ranking as the most consumed beverage in the world today?"}, {"Description": "Tea_MA01", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_MA01", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "The mythical figure credited with discovering tea is the divine farmer, Shennong."}, {"Description": "Tea_MA02", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_MA02", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Originally, tea was consumed as a food; it was either eaten as a vegetable or cooked with grain porridge."}, {"Description": "Tea_MA03", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_MA03", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "The standard method became heating tea, packing it into portable cakes, grinding it into powder, and then mixing it with hot water to create a frothy beverage."}, {"Description": "Tea_MA04", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_MA04", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "During the Ming Dynasty, the Chinese emperor shifted the standard from tea pressed into cakes to using loose-leaf tea."}, {"Description": "Tea_MA05", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_MA05", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "The other two essential Chinese export goods that gave the country economic power were porcelain and silk."}, {"Description": "Tea_MA06", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_MA06", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Britain initially paid for Chinese tea with silver, but this proved to be too expensive, so they switched to trading opium as a more sustainable alternative."}, {"Description": "Tea_MA07", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_MA07", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "The Qing Dynasty ceded the port of Hong Kong to the British and was forced to resume trading on unfavorable terms."}, {"Description": "Tea_MA08", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_MA08", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "They commissioned botanist Robert Fortune to secretly smuggle tea trees and experienced tea workers out of China and into Darjeeling, India."}, {"Description": "Tea_MA09", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_MA09", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "The clipper ship was developed due to intense competition between Western trading companies, who were racing to transport tea to Europe first to maximize profits."}, {"Description": "Tea_MA10", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_MA10", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Tea is the second most consumed beverage in the world, after water."}, {"Description": "Tea_R01", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_R01", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "This is a direct recall of a key figure and the foundational legend mentioned at the start of the video."}, {"Description": "Tea_R02", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_R02", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "This question requires the learner to explain the initial state of tea consumption, demonstrating comprehension of its evolution from a food to a beverage."}, {"Description": "Tea_R03", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_R03", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "This question asks for an explanation of a specific historical process mentioned in the video, testing the learner's understanding of how a particular type of tea was made."}, {"Description": "Tea_R04", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_R04", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "This question checks for understanding of a key transition in tea's physical form and preparation method, which marked a major turning point in its history."}, {"Description": "Tea_R05", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_R05", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "This question tests the recall of specific factual information about China's key exports during the period it held a monopoly on tea."}, {"Description": "Tea_R06", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_R06", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "This question tests the learner's ability to analyze the cause (high cost of silver) for a significant effect (the switch to the opium trade)."}, {"Description": "Tea_R07", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_R07", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "This question requires the learner to recall and connect the outcome of a major conflict to its specific political and economic consequences for China."}, {"Description": "Tea_R08", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_R08", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "This question requires the learner to analyze the specific actions (industrial espionage) taken by a key entity to overcome a major economic obstacle (China's monopoly)."}, {"Description": "Tea_R09", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_R09", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "This requires the learner to analyze the cause-and-effect relationship between economic competition in the tea trade and a specific technological innovation."}, {"Description": "Tea_R10", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Tea_R10", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "This tests the recall of a concluding fact that puts the entire history of tea into a modern context, demonstrating the beverage's global significance."}, {"Description": "Tea_F01", "Type": "Recipient", "Field": "Tea_F01", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false}, {"Description": "Tea_F02", "Type": "Recipient", "Field": "Tea_F02", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false}, {"Description": "Tea_F03", "Type": "Recipient", "Field": "Tea_F03", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false}, {"Description": "Tea_F04", "Type": "Recipient", "Field": "Tea_F04", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false}, {"Description": "Tea_F05", "Type": "Recipient", "Field": "Tea_F05", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false}, {"Description": "Tea_F06", "Type": "Recipient", "Field": "Tea_F06", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false}, {"Description": "Tea_F07", "Type": "Recipient", "Field": "Tea_F07", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false}, {"Description": "Tea_F08", "Type": "Recipient", "Field": "Tea_F08", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false}, {"Description": "Tea_F09", "Type": "Recipient", "Field": "Tea_F09", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false}, {"Description": "Tea_F10", "Type": "Recipient", "Field": "Tea_F10", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false}, {"Description": "Video", "Type": "Custom", "Field": "Video", "VariableType": "String", "DataVisibility": [], "AnalyzeText": false, "Value": "Tea"}]}, {"Type": "Standard", "ID": "BL_