on": "You have completed Part 2 of the study.  You will be emailed with an invitation to take part in P...", "QuestionText": "You have completed Part 2 of the study.&nbsp;<br><br>You will be emailed with an invitation to take part in Part 3 seven days from now at around 10am, and you will be able to complete it until around 8pm (UK time).<br><br>Please remember that you will only be eligible for reimbursement after completing all three parts of the study.&nbsp;<br><br>Clicking the next button will end Part 2 and redirect you back to Prolific.&nbsp;", "QuestionText_Unsafe": "You have completed Part 2 of the study.&nbsp;<br><br>You will be emailed with an invitation to take part in Part 3 in two days at around 10am, and you will be able to complete it until around 8pm (UK time).<br><br>Please remember that you will only be eligible for reimbursement after completing all three parts of the study.&nbsp;<br><br>Clicking the next button will end Part 2 and redirect you back to Prolific.&nbsp;", "QuestionType": "DB", "Selector": "TB", "Validation": {"Settings": {"Type": "None"}}, "DataExportTag": "part2_end", "QuestionID": "QID1218945892"}}, {"SurveyID": "SV_cHECykB35imz7UO", "Element": "SQ", "PrimaryAttribute": "QID1218945893", "SecondaryAttribute": "Part 2 information:  This is Part 2 of the study.  You will answer 10 short-answer questions (SAQ.", "TertiaryAttribute": null, "Payload": {"ChoiceOrder": [], "Configuration": {"QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"}, "DataVisibility": {"Hidden": false, "Private": false}, "DefaultChoices": false, "GradingData": [], "Language": [], "NextAnswerId": 1, "NextChoiceId": 4, "QuestionDescription": "Part 2 information:  This is Part 2 of the study.  You will answer 10 short-answer questions (SAQ...", "QuestionJS": "Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\t/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page loads*/\n\t\n\tQualtrics.SurveyEngine.setEmbeddedData( 'Group', \"SAQ\" );\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(fun